OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after trench collapsed
OL,4,Aon labourer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed after a
OL,7,Fconstruction worker died when a trench
OL,8,Fcollapsed on him in 2020.
OL,10,FPeter Clifford, 63, formerly of Holland
OL,11,FRoad, Felixstowe, Suffolk, appeared at
OL,12,FIpswich Crown Court after pleading
OL,13,Fguilty to gross negligence
OL,14,Fmanslaughter.
OL,16,FWorker Dale Baker, 30, from Felixstowe,
OL,17,Fsustained serious injuries while
OL,18,Fcarrying out renovation work on a
OL,19,FWoodbridge house on 15 December 2020
OL,20,Fand died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
