OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after trench collapsed
OL,4,Aon labourer
OL,5,
OL,6,FClifford was sentenced to eight years
OL,7,Fand 10 months imprisonment and banned
OL,8,Ffrom acting as a company director for
OL,9,Fthe next 10 years.
